      "name": "Hatching Brood",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The Brood Mother looks to your webbing as places to give new life. It summons a collection of Broodling’s, selecting a number of your Web Anchors currently active, dispelling up to 4, and summoning two Broodling’s per dispelled Web Anchor, each pair in the original spaces of the dispelled Web Anchors. The Broodling’s all follow a single directive. Consume the Brood Mothers prey, by any means. These creatures cannot be controlled by normal means, they simply take cues from their mother attacking whatever their Brood Mother last attacked. These Broodling’s also uses your highest jutsu attack bonus and save DC for abilities that call for it.</p>",
